textMapHash":1124765406,"text":"この単語、最近聞いたばかりだった気がする。","nextNodeIds":[400030910]},{"nodeId":400030909,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4053430462,"text":"パイモンは「夜叉」を知っているの？","nextNodeIds":[400030910]},{"nodeId":400030907,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":853626254,"text":"護法夜叉…！","nextNodeIds":[400030908,400030909]},{"nodeId":400030910,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":83492254,"text":"そ、そうだ…璃月の人に教えてもらった…夜叉も璃月を守る仙人だって…","nextNodeIds":[400030911]},{"nodeId":400030911,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":665192766,"text":"影で人類の世界を守り、何も知らない凡人のために妖魔を退治する…","nextNodeIds":[400030912]},{"nodeId":400030912,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3933246006,"text":"普通、それは善人と言わないのか？","nextNodeIds":[400030913]},{"nodeId":400030913,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2105969670,"text":"…いや、夜叉の「護法」は人類に対する善意から来たものではない。","nextNodeIds":[400030914]},{"nodeId":400030914,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":532052542,"text":"うっ…海灯祭は英雄を記念するための祭りなのに。","nextNodeIds":[400030915]},{"nodeId":400030915,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":401388462,"text":"璃月を守ってきた英雄たちの中で、せっかく今でも生きている英雄に出会ったと思ったら、自分たちを記念する祭りに無関心だな。","nextNodeIds":[400030916]},{"nodeId":400030916,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":1964081126,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[400030917]},{"nodeId":400030917,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3433857894,"text":"魈さん…？えっと、魈仙人…？さっきはどうしてあの怪しいヤツを直接阻止しなかったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[400030918]},{"nodeId":400030918,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":1439694870,"text":"妖魔によるものかと思って、来てみただけだ。","nextNodeIds":[400030919]},{"nodeId":400030919,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":4256152702,"text":"仙と魔の世界で、何かが解き放たれそうになっているものがあったら、それは我の責任だ。","nextNodeIds":[400030920]},{"nodeId":400030920,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":3239193510,"text":"しかし、今回の脅威は人類の世界——お前たちの世界からやって来ている。だからこれはお前の責任だ、人類の旅人よ。","nextNodeIds":[400030921]},{"nodeId":400030921,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":111486054,"text":"いざという時のために…そういう自覚をお前にも持っておいてほしい。","nextNodeIds":[400030922]},{"nodeId":400030922,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":3766255614,"text":"この妖魔を退治するための槍纓を、凡人の血で染めさせるわけにはいかない。","nextNodeIds":[400030923]},{"nodeId":400030923,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1903634398,"text":"これは——","nextNodeIds":[400030924]},{"nodeId":400030925,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1307709518,"text":"パイモンは分かる？","nextNodeIds":[400030926]},{"nodeId":400030924,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":1928690494,"text":"あの者が残した暗号だ。","nextNodeIds":[400030925]},{"nodeId":400030926,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2762123262,"text":"分からないな。","nextNodeIds":[400030927]},{"nodeId":400030927,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":1449160630,"text":"ならばお前たちがどこまでできるのか、我に示せ。","nextNodeIds":[400030928]},{"nodeId":400030929,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2892397670,"text":"おめでたい色だ。","nextNodeIds":[400030930]},{"nodeId":400030928,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10204,"speakerName":"魈","textMapHash":2326911734,"text":"我がやるとなると、「赤い海灯祭」にならないとも限らない。","nextNodeIds":[400030929]},{"nodeId":400030930,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":749208326,"text":"想像しただけで怖い！","nextNodeIds":[400030932]},{"nodeId